    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `invoke_platform_model.py` that invokes a provider-managed model, I need to choose a concrete external provider and use their specific client library or API endpoint. For this example, I will use Amazon Bedrock, which is a service that provides access to foundation models from Amazon and other providers. I will import the necessary client library and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
